# TR House Telvanni: "Supply Chain" (TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q2). Rathra sends the player after Mithras's mining caravan on
# the road from Llothanis to Ranyon-ruhn ("chores" adds "Master Mithras", whose Choice 1 adds "ambush the caravan":
# 10, which enables the caravaner). The caravaner
# force-greets within 250 units; his death logs TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q2_a 100 (TR_m1_q_PickDeliverer_sc), and holding
# the three crated picks and the two loose ones logs TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q2_b 100 (TR_m1_q_DeliveryPicks, OnPCAdd);
# Rathra takes them (100, +5 reputation).
# PositionCell and Position stand in for the travel, the kill for the fight, the RemoveItem/AddItem pair for the
# container menu on the crate. Ref FormIDs carry TR_Mainland's slot 09: 0937BDE2 the caravaner, 09EAD6F2 and
# 096F6592 the loose picks; MWScript names the crate by its once-placed base id.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_rathra_q1_book --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ht_rathra_q2_start
run
player->PositionCell 4123 3980 14430 0 "Tel Ouada, Tower: Rathra's Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Rathra"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Rathra
ask chores
ask Master Mithras
choose 1
ask ambush the caravan
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q2 == 10
bye
end

case ht_rathra_q2_caravan
run
player->Position 252645 104000 760 0
until 900 "TR_m1_q_PickDeliverer"->GetDistance player < 1000
wait 150
console 0937BDE2.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q2_a >= 100
take 09EAD6F2
take 096F6592
run
"TR_m1_q_PickCrate"->RemoveItem "TR_m1_q_DeliveryPick" 3
player->AddItem "TR_m1_q_DeliveryPick" 3
until 300 GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q2_b >= 100
end

case ht_rathra_q2_done
run
player->PositionCell 4123 3980 14430 0 "Tel Ouada, Tower: Rathra's Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Rathra"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Rathra
ask ambush the caravan
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q2 == 100
bye
end
